    "quote": "Manufacturers shall report to the relevant regulator every thermal incident involving fire, smoke, uncontrolled overheating, injury, or material property damage, whether or not the cause is known, within 5 business days of becoming aware of it. Incidents presenting an ongoing risk of injury or fire shall be reported promptly and no later than 24 hours after awareness. Manufacturers shall notify affected customers as soon as practicable, and within 5 business days when a continuing safety risk is identified."
   },
