    "quote": "New home battery systems shall include remote emergency shut-off capability. Manufacturers shall make a good-faith effort to retrofit installed units that can support the capability, and shall enable it within 6 years after adoption of this standard. Where retrofit is not technically feasible, the manufacturer shall document the reason and provide customers with clear emergency isolation instructions."
   },
